    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάστροφ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twisted, distorted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. καὶ ἔμπηρα καὶ ἀπόπληκτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.167
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορφὴ καὶ φρένες δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					673
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				447
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					794
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κόρας ἑλίσσουσ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1122
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1166
			</span></i> (lyr.); of a person, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοὺς
				ὀφθαλμούς, τὸ σῶμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.339f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φως</span>
			<i>incorrectly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.152
				</span></i>
			.</div>
